            "review_title": "Review at Hotpot Story",
            "review_text": "Ajarn Mark\nBangkok, Thailand73 contributions\n0\nHygiene, no thank you\nJul 2017 • Solo\nI was in SC Vivo city on Saturday and I went to the restroom to wash my hands and just before I finished washing my hands, a stall door was opened and a guy (mid 20's) in chef's dress appeared from there and just walked out without washing his hands. If he were a normal guy, I wouldnt mind but then I found it strange for a chef to use toilet and then not washing his hands, not even with water. He went inside Hot Pot Story on 4th floor of SC Vivo City and probably started handling food. So it appears that the food there is no very clean. Beware of eating there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 23, 2017",
